    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">By 2012, daily international freight traffic on the project corridor increased to 177 trucks (baseline: 10 trucks in 2006) 
Progress/Status: Daily international freight traffic in 2012 was on average 82 trucks per day. 
Data Source: National economic and social statistics, and MOTC&amp;apos;s surveys and statistics 
Actual value:</narrative>
    </description>
