    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">By 2012, travel time between Dushanbe and the Kyrgyz border reduced to 7 hours (baseline: 10 hours in 2006) 
Progress/Status: Travel time from the border to Dushanbe redcued to 7 hours in 2012. 
Data Source: National economic and social statistics, and MOTC&amp;apos;s surveys and statistics 
